                              "type": "_v-heading-content-des",
                              "settings": {
                                "heading": "<p>Jackery Solar Roof seamlessly integrates efficient power generation technology with architectural aesthetics. As the world's first XBC curved solar tiles, it eliminates the conflict between traditional photovoltaic products and the appearance of buildings, truly achieving \"invisible power generation\". As an important part of Jackery's entire home energy ecosystem, the Jackery Solar Roof takes into account both efficient power generation and visual design. The battery conversion efficiency is over 25%, and it is compatible with 90% of existing rooftops. </p>",
